  "description": "When we were developing Flyway, we set out to create an extremely versatile gravel bike. The carbon fiber frame is a lightweight and efficient pedaling platform; our Class 5 VRS™ design helps smooth out rough gravel roads for sustained speed. And the geometry? It’s just as suited to putting down power in a pace line as it is exploring your favorite gravel roads at your favorite pace. We equipped Flyway with plenty of frame and fork cargo mounts so you can set it up for fast-and-light race days or load it up for out-all-day adventures. The SRAM Apex Eagle AXS components ensure effortless, precision shifting every mile of the way for a ride that’s thoroughly refined.",
